  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Start Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - 'Welcome to the construction floor! Here you''ll be building each component of
    the TRANSFORMER.


    Before we begin, let''s first introduce you to the controls.'
  - You can move the camera around by using the WASD keys, rotate with Q and E, and
    zoom in and out with the mouse wheel. Don't worry! If you ever forget the controls,
    you can press the hint (?) button in the top right to get a refresh of the controls.
  - Let's start by moving the camera around!
